sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (argo-b3, H3, sdr-api)
  participant D as DSA API
  participant DB as DSA primary DB
  participant WF as accessionWF
  participant PF as purl-fetcher
  C->>D: POST /v1/objects/:druid/versions (open)
  D->>DB: copy last closed version to version N+1, opened pointer
  D-->>C: cocina with version N+1
  C->>D: GET /v1/objects/:druid
  D-->>C: DROWithMetadata, ETag = external lock
  C->>D: PATCH /v1/objects/:druid with If-Match
  alt lock matches
    D->>DB: update jsonb columns of open version, bump lock
    D-->>C: 200 with new ETag
  else lock stale
    D-->>C: 412 ETag mismatch
  end
  C->>D: POST /v1/objects/:druid/versions/current/close
  D->>DB: set closed_at, move head and last_closed pointers
  D->>DB: create or move user version per user_version_mode
  D->>WF: start accessionWF for version N+1
  WF->>PF: publish user version M (PUT /v1/purls/:druid)
